{"unit_id": "tag:02WV:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>是<MATH_0003>上的概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0004>是<MATH_0005>上的、在<MATH_0006>之上的平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）等价关系（equivalence relation）。若商（quotient）<MATH_0007>是代数空间（algebraic space），则<MATH_0008>是平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）且满射（surjective）的。因此<MATH_0009>是代数空间（algebraic space）<MATH_0010>的一个呈示（presentation）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "<ACCENT_0001>tale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "equivalence relation", "target_term": "等价关系"}, {"source_term": "quotient", "target_term": "商"}, {"source_term": "algebraic space", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"source_term": "<ACCENT_0002>tale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "algebraic space", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"source_term": "presentation", "target_term": "呈示"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "作为基底及关系载体的概形，暂定译法。"}, {"source_term": "<ACCENT_0001>tale", "target_term": "平展", "context": "等价关系的平展性，暂定译法。"}, {"source_term": "<ACCENT_0002>tale", "target_term": "平展", "context": "商映射的平展性，暂定译法。"}, {"source_term": "equivalence relation", "target_term": "等价关系", "context": "概形上的关系，暂定译法。"}, {"source_term": "quotient", "target_term": "商", "context": "关系的商，暂定译法。"}, {"source_term": "algebraic space", "target_term": "代数空间", "context": "商的类型，暂定译法。"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射", "context": "商映射的满射性，暂定译法。"}, {"source_term": "presentation", "target_term": "呈示", "context": "由平展满射给出的呈示，暂定译法。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02WV:proof", "translation": "以<MATH_0001>记所讨论的态射（morphism）。设<MATH_0002>是概形（scheme），并设<MATH_0003>是态射（morphism）。我们须证明态射（morphism）（概形（schemes）之间的）<MATH_0004>是平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）且满射（surjective）的。态射（morphism）<MATH_0005>对应于一个fppf覆盖（fppf covering）<MATH_0006>以及态射（morphisms）<MATH_0007>，使得\n<MATH_0008>\n通过<MATH_0009>分解，且<MATH_0010>。因此\n<MATH_0011>\n由于<MATH_0012>是平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）且满射（surjective）的，我们推出<MATH_0013>到<MATH_0014>的基变换（base change）是满射（surjective）且平展（<ACCENT_0003>tale）的。由于满射（surjective）且平展（<ACCENT_0004>tale）这一性质在fpqc拓扑（fpqc topology）中对基底是局部的（参见注记<REF_0001>），证明完成。\n", "allowed_english": ["fppf", "fpqc"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "<ACCENT_0001>tale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "fppf covering", "target_term": "fppf覆盖"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "<ACCENT_0002>tale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "<ACCENT_0003>tale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "<ACCENT_0004>tale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "fpqc topology", "target_term": "fpqc拓扑"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "商映射及测试态射，暂定译法。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "测试概形，暂定译法。"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "态射的定义域与值域，暂定译法。"}, {"source_term": "<ACCENT_0001>tale", "target_term": "平展", "context": "基变换后的平展性，暂定译法。"}, {"source_term": "<ACCENT_0002>tale", "target_t